WEBVTT

00:30.460 --> 00:33.050
Is this... a thousand years in the future?

00:34.040 --> 00:37.370
The aroma of saltwater...
The stench of stone and metal...

00:37.370 --> 00:39.240
Are there no trees or plants?

00:41.120 --> 00:43.100
No signs of life, either...

00:43.100 --> 00:46.070
I don't understand. What happened here?

00:53.920 --> 00:55.610
Well, either way...

01:00.790 --> 01:03.540
ARLE KIRLESIO

01:01.580 --> 01:04.280
...if I've been sent to this place,

01:04.960 --> 01:07.530
then it must mean the goddess
is going to be reborn here.

01:09.710 --> 01:11.750
The sky is moving...

01:11.750 --> 01:14.450
No. The land is moving...?

01:17.920 --> 01:20.660
A dragon? What an odd shape...

01:21.170 --> 01:23.470
It's a human mode of transport.

01:24.040 --> 01:29.270
This is certainly a surprise, being granted an audience
with the Great Elf Hero, Arle Kirlesio...

01:30.440 --> 01:34.330
Oops. It would be rude of me not to introduce myself.

01:34.330 --> 01:38.160
I'm Nefakess. Nefakess Void Lord.

01:38.160 --> 01:42.450
I don't care what your name is.
How do you know who I am?

01:42.450 --> 01:45.290
Have you come from the past, too?

01:45.580 --> 01:47.580
Something like that.

01:47.580 --> 01:50.870
Except you and I have two vastly different objectives.

01:51.870 --> 01:57.380
You're here to destroy the goddess' vessel
using Crozax, the Evil-Slashing Blade, aren't you?

01:57.380 --> 02:01.600
So am I to assume that you are
the guardian of the goddess' vessel?

02:02.080 --> 02:03.930
And if I was? What then?

02:03.930 --> 02:04.890
I'd kill you!

02:07.000 --> 02:07.870
An illusion...?

02:07.870 --> 02:13.410
I can hold off on dealing with the humans for now,
but I'm going to have to ask you to leave, Madam Hero.

03:56.370 --> 03:58.420
THE ELF HERO

04:03.970 --> 04:05.050
Miss Selia!

04:17.650 --> 04:19.030
Rua Meires!

04:20.820 --> 04:22.280
Farga!

04:24.660 --> 04:28.160
Holy Protection, resistant to all forms
of lower level sorcery...

04:28.620 --> 04:30.950
It's a Void mimicking an angel...

04:31.330 --> 04:36.170
Come then, Fallen Angel of Nothingness...
Let me show you what TRUE sorcery looks like.

04:39.420 --> 04:42.260
That's the direction Lady Selia and the kid went!

04:43.920 --> 04:46.720
The drone I had following them is gone...

04:46.720 --> 04:47.990
Let's move!

04:59.940 --> 05:02.820
Crush my enemies! Beruda Gira!

05:12.500 --> 05:17.000
Too slow. Level 9 sorcery: Madia Zolf!

05:25.680 --> 05:29.050
I'll even throw in an extra treat: Rias Gia!

05:35.000 --> 05:37.770
I suppose that was overkill for an insignificant worm...

05:45.070 --> 05:47.170
Leo! You alright?

05:47.170 --> 05:49.910
It was a tough fight, but I managed to defeat it.

05:50.370 --> 05:52.460
Are you hurt, Miss Selia?

05:52.460 --> 05:54.500
No, I think I can—

05:54.500 --> 05:56.000
Don't push yourself too hard.

05:56.460 --> 05:59.080
Even with a Vampire Queen's innate healing abilities,

05:59.080 --> 06:02.210
recovering from a serious injury like that
is going to take some time.

06:02.500 --> 06:05.030
Right... Sorry, Leo.

06:07.040 --> 06:09.290
We'll need to find somewhere to hide...

06:09.290 --> 06:12.450
We can't discount the possibility
that more Voids will show up.

06:17.620 --> 06:19.290
Well, speak of the devil...

06:19.290 --> 06:20.770
Wait a second, Leo!

06:26.790 --> 06:28.780
The Duke's family crest...

06:29.750 --> 06:33.280
ORDER OF HOUSE CRYSTALIA

06:29.750 --> 06:33.280
WILLIAM RICHMOND

06:30.120 --> 06:32.740
It's a pleasure to see you again, milady.

06:33.750 --> 06:36.750
Aren't you... my father's...?

06:36.750 --> 06:40.990
Indeed. I'm the head of the Order of House Crystalia,
under your father's command.

06:41.500 --> 06:43.950
My name is William Richmond.

06:44.500 --> 06:50.050
And although I no longer possess a physical body,
I hastened to your side as quickly as possible.

06:50.330 --> 06:52.350
That's right... I knew it...

06:52.350 --> 06:54.920
Souls of the dead with deep,
lingering attachments or regrets

06:54.920 --> 06:57.620
becoming trapped at the site of large-scale battles...

06:58.170 --> 07:02.810
It wasn't an uncommon occurrence a millennium ago,
but this is a first for the present day.

07:02.810 --> 07:06.950
If you're here, milady, then you must've
received our distress signal.

07:07.580 --> 07:09.360
Wait, that was YOU?

07:09.710 --> 07:16.240
Yes. However, we were not seeking rescue.
Rather, we wished to send out a warning.

07:16.240 --> 07:20.920
Should things continue as they are,
the tragedy of six years ago is doomed to repeat itself.

07:21.250 --> 07:22.080
What?

07:22.080 --> 07:26.570
The Seventh Assault Garden may very well
be overtaken by a Stampede.

07:27.170 --> 07:30.450
A new Void Lord has appeared in these ruins.

07:30.920 --> 07:35.850
The fact that we were able to manifest ourselves
is a result of its influence.

07:36.120 --> 07:43.000
I suppose it's not too far-fetched, but this didn't happen
back when Arakael Void Lord appeared...

07:43.000 --> 07:43.770
How come...?

07:43.770 --> 07:48.830
The Void Lord melded itself with the city's power plant,
and now it's amassing energy.

07:48.830 --> 07:51.040
It's bound to awaken before long.

07:51.040 --> 07:53.240
Then we'd better hurry up and go check—

07:55.000 --> 07:59.660
If we want to evacuate the Assault Garden,
we'll have to provide definitive proof of a threat.

07:59.660 --> 08:05.700
And I highly doubt the humans of this era will accept
"A ghost told us" as a reliable source of information...

08:08.000 --> 08:09.670
Take it easy, Miss Selia.

08:09.670 --> 08:10.710
But I—

08:10.710 --> 08:14.170
First, we need to find
somewhere for you to rest and relax.

08:14.170 --> 08:16.680
In that case, let us take you to the mansion.

08:16.680 --> 08:19.030
I've already arranged a car for you.

08:19.750 --> 08:20.430
Huh?

08:20.710 --> 08:25.830
I took the liberty of making preparations
when I learned of your arrival, milady.

08:25.830 --> 08:28.150
How does a ghost drive a car...?

08:28.150 --> 08:31.690
The soul is a form of mana
that's been separated from a person's body.

08:31.690 --> 08:36.910
Assuming that vehicle is a magical device,
I wouldn't be surprised if they're able to manipulate it.

08:36.910 --> 08:39.620
You know a lot about ghosts, don't you?

08:39.620 --> 08:40.750
Here we are.

08:40.750 --> 08:44.740
But... it's difficult to trust them at those speeds.

08:48.790 --> 08:50.300
My horses will pull us.

08:50.300 --> 08:51.450
What?!

08:53.330 --> 08:56.750
They've gotten dusty.
Maybe it's 'cause I haven't used them in a while...

08:56.750 --> 08:57.680
Really?

09:01.310 --> 09:02.890
We're moving so fast!

09:03.290 --> 09:07.060
Well, they're not just any horses.
They're Underworld Derby champions.

09:12.540 --> 09:16.200
It's much quieter now.
Perhaps the battle is already over...

09:21.040 --> 09:22.120
Who are you?

09:23.330 --> 09:26.500
A survivor! You're not injured, are you?

09:34.470 --> 09:36.240
She's skilled with a sword...

09:37.170 --> 09:39.910
My apologies, but you two
won't stand a chance against her.

09:40.580 --> 09:41.780
Let me handle this.

09:46.350 --> 09:50.780
More bizarre powers... So then you're friends of his, too?

09:51.520 --> 09:55.120
Of who...? What's your problem with Holy Swords?

09:55.120 --> 09:58.240
Aren't you the one who sent out that distress signal?

09:58.240 --> 09:59.570
Enough small talk!

10:01.620 --> 10:03.410
She dodged Sakuya's blow?!

10:24.580 --> 10:25.780
We're done here.

10:26.460 --> 10:27.490
What...?

10:29.270 --> 10:32.900
Had you not been wounded... I would have lost.

11:06.830 --> 11:08.480
I'm starting to feel better.

11:08.480 --> 11:10.750
Just don't rush it, okay?

11:10.750 --> 11:14.120
Okay. Um... hey, Leo?

11:14.120 --> 11:15.270
What's the matter?

11:15.580 --> 11:20.400
Sorry, but... I need... some of your blood...

11:20.400 --> 11:25.120
Ah, recovering from your injuries
must be depleting your mana supply. It's fine by me—

11:26.370 --> 11:28.620
Thank you! I'm sorry, Leo!

11:30.920 --> 11:35.380
At this rate, she's going to drink
every last drop of blood in my body!

11:35.380 --> 11:39.670
I have no other choice...
the marks of control and subservience are my only—

11:39.670 --> 11:41.220
Selia? Selia!

11:42.620 --> 11:44.500
Just a little more...

11:44.500 --> 11:47.010
Uh, Selia? Do you copy?

11:48.180 --> 11:49.870
F-Finé?!

11:49.870 --> 11:53.540
Guess I finally got through.
Your voice sounds kind of shaky though...

11:53.540 --> 11:54.900
N-Nope, I'm fine!

11:54.900 --> 11:58.040
You engaged a Void earlier, right? Are you okay?

11:58.040 --> 12:04.000
Yeah, we took it down. I sustained a small injury,
but it shouldn't interfere with the operation.

12:04.000 --> 12:05.580
And Leo? Is he safe?

12:05.580 --> 12:10.670
It was touch and go for a minute there,
but I pulled through. Thanks to YOU, Miss Finé.

12:10.670 --> 12:11.710
Huh?

12:11.710 --> 12:13.330
Stop that, you big meanie...

12:13.670 --> 12:16.120
Finé, I've got something to report.

12:16.120 --> 12:16.920
Go ahead.

12:16.920 --> 12:20.500
It's possible that a Void Lord
is hiding somewhere in the city.

12:20.500 --> 12:22.080
Are you serious?!

12:22.080 --> 12:25.910
And if the Void Lord is tampering with the power plant,
that might explain why it's been reactivated.

12:27.120 --> 12:28.390
That makes sense...

12:28.390 --> 12:30.540
Let's regroup and go check it out.

12:30.540 --> 12:35.610
Good idea. Once we're done treating this
survivor's wounds, we'll head for the Central Garden.

12:35.610 --> 12:37.440
You found a survivor?!

12:37.440 --> 12:39.870
I'll fill you in on the details later.

12:39.870 --> 12:43.920
Understood. Then let's rendezvous
at the Crystalia estate.

12:43.920 --> 12:44.990
Roger.

12:45.830 --> 12:51.370
I know I gave you permission to drink my blood,
but if you drink too much, I could pass out.

12:51.370 --> 12:56.290
Sorry, Leo. My head got all fuzzy
and I kinda spaced out...

12:56.290 --> 13:00.120
But, uh... is it alright if I drink just a little more...?

13:00.120 --> 13:03.750
Hold that thought, Miss Selia.
There's something I want to give you.

13:03.750 --> 13:06.120
What, like a present?

13:11.420 --> 13:12.540
A dress...?

13:12.540 --> 13:17.280
Yes. An accessory of the finest quality,
awarded to my most faithful minion.

13:17.750 --> 13:23.120
The True Ancestor Dress has the ability to convert
a Vampire Queen's mana into physical strength.

13:23.120 --> 13:29.330
Your power will increase exponentially, but your mana
will be consumed at a rapid rate, so use it wisely.

13:29.330 --> 13:31.910
I hope I can get the hang of it...

13:32.710 --> 13:33.450
Huh?

13:34.580 --> 13:36.490
Wh-What...?

13:38.370 --> 13:44.950
When you wish to put it on, all you have to do is
imagine yourself wearing it. It shouldn't be too difficult.

13:45.540 --> 13:49.830
O-Okay then... But why are you giving me this now?

13:49.830 --> 13:55.210
I didn't think you were ready just yet...
Nevertheless, anything could happen from here on out.

13:55.210 --> 13:59.730
They took us by surprise last time,
but I can't afford to have you getting hurt again.

14:00.250 --> 14:02.070
So you were worried about me?

14:02.070 --> 14:06.990
I-I'm asking you to keep yourself safe! That's all it is...

14:07.250 --> 14:09.870
One more thing... Take these.

14:10.710 --> 14:12.620
Skeleton keychains...?

14:13.120 --> 14:15.040
A good luck charm of sorts.

14:15.870 --> 14:17.530
Thanks, Leo...

14:18.330 --> 14:19.540
I'll take good care of them!

14:21.250 --> 14:22.670
No thanks necessary...

14:28.080 --> 14:34.220
There, all finished. I stitched your wound shut,
but if you move too much, it'll open back up.

14:34.220 --> 14:39.900
The fact that you were severely injured and held
your own against Sakuya in a sword fight is remarkable...

14:40.500 --> 14:43.770
I found the same outfit. Go ahead and get changed.

14:45.250 --> 14:48.950
I'm Sakuya Sieglinde. What's your name?

14:50.000 --> 14:53.170
Arle... Arle Kirlesio.

14:53.170 --> 14:55.910
Arle? That's a nice name.

14:55.910 --> 14:59.960
So, is there a reason you attacked us
right outta the gate like that?

15:00.250 --> 15:06.170
My enemy, he controls these monsters...
And I had assumed the three of you were his allies.

15:06.170 --> 15:09.000
"Monsters"? Do you mean Voids?

15:09.000 --> 15:12.760
I don't know what they're called.
But this thing was absurdly large.

15:12.760 --> 15:15.390
So you got hurt while battling Voids...

15:15.920 --> 15:17.870
I should've known not to let my guard down.

15:18.500 --> 15:21.600
"Arle Kirlesio," an elf...

15:22.000 --> 15:25.460
You're not listed in the Third Assault Garden's database.

15:25.460 --> 15:27.530
Huh? Then...

15:28.150 --> 15:30.570
Where exactly did you come from?

15:30.570 --> 15:34.330
I could ask YOU the same thing.
What are you doing here?

15:34.330 --> 15:38.490
We're an exploration team
hailing from the Seventh Assault Garden.

15:38.960 --> 15:44.120
This city was laid to waste six years ago. We were sent
to figure out why it suddenly became functional again.

15:44.630 --> 15:48.970
Ah... Which means mankind
still has its own place in the world...

15:48.970 --> 15:53.640
I answered your questions.
So tell me, why are YOU here?

15:54.000 --> 15:59.020
I must complete a task that was entrusted to me.
I've come here to vanquish the goddess.

15:59.020 --> 16:00.270
"Goddess"...?

16:00.920 --> 16:03.120
It seems the legend has been forgotten...

16:03.120 --> 16:05.820
Then again, a thousand years IS a long time...

16:05.820 --> 16:13.280
I appreciate you treating my wounds, and I realize now
that you three aren't my enemies... but pay me no mind.

16:14.370 --> 16:15.920
Whoa, don't overdo it!

16:15.920 --> 16:17.570
I'll be fine on my—

16:21.210 --> 16:24.460
It's too late to wander around outside,
even if you go right after you eat.

16:27.330 --> 16:28.620
What's that?

16:28.620 --> 16:31.160
One of my favorite snacks. It's called "monaka."

16:31.830 --> 16:34.990
A snack...? Quit treating me like a child!

16:37.220 --> 16:41.120
Regardless of the circumstances,
we can't just leave you behind.

16:41.120 --> 16:43.640
We're duty-bound to protect you.

16:43.640 --> 16:45.570
You can trust us, I promise.

16:50.750 --> 16:56.490
Arle Kirlesio... The last to train under
Master Swordsman Shardark, one of the Six Heroes.

16:56.950 --> 17:01.080
The woman skilled enough to assassinate
several of the demonic army's generals

17:01.080 --> 17:02.960
AND infiltrate Death Hold three times.

17:03.290 --> 17:06.620
The Elf Hero who attempted to kill my master.

17:06.620 --> 17:09.070
But what's she doing here in the future...?

17:12.170 --> 17:16.540
We waited patiently,
biding our time for a thousand long years.

17:16.540 --> 17:20.210
The Great Goddess was the only one
who rose up against the Radiant Deities,

17:20.210 --> 17:23.070
and now her resurrection draws near...

17:24.460 --> 17:26.160
This had better be important...

17:28.250 --> 17:30.320
Someone slaughtered the angel?

17:30.620 --> 17:34.120
The Elf Hero...? No, a Holy Swordsman...?

17:34.120 --> 17:38.160
Although I find it hard to believe
that a mere human managed to defeat that thing...

17:39.790 --> 17:44.370
Well, no matter. Perhaps it's time I take out the trash.

17:51.500 --> 17:55.160
Thanks... but I think I can walk on my own now.

18:03.170 --> 18:06.480
Careful now, Selia.
Watch out for the thorns on those roses.

18:06.480 --> 18:10.250
Selia, would you like me
to teach you how to press flowers?

18:10.250 --> 18:13.650
Selia! Let's have a wrestling match
on the grass over there!

18:34.210 --> 18:36.410
This chair is comfortable...

18:37.000 --> 18:39.570
Brings back memories of the good old days.

18:55.330 --> 18:56.900
Anything with eggs!

18:56.900 --> 18:58.820
We should at least make a cake.

18:59.370 --> 19:00.660
I baked a pie.

19:01.000 --> 19:01.670
Pie again?

19:01.670 --> 19:03.620
Man, I'm starving!

19:07.290 --> 19:08.370
Huh?

19:22.460 --> 19:26.140
The room where my father's study used to be...

19:38.290 --> 19:40.450
Huh? What?

19:47.620 --> 19:50.370
Which story are we reading today, Father?

19:52.000 --> 19:55.740
Let's see here...
How about "The Hero and the Demon Lord"?

19:56.330 --> 19:58.760
Really? Again?

19:58.760 --> 20:04.970
Long ago, in a barren wasteland where not a single
shrub grew, there was a castle made of bones.

20:05.500 --> 20:08.370
And in the castle lived an evil demon lord.

20:09.670 --> 20:13.920
The Demon Lord terrorized people.
He thought scaring them was funny.

20:13.920 --> 20:17.870
This made God angry, so He sent a hero to help.

20:17.870 --> 20:22.240
Using the power bestowed upon him by God,
the Hero defeated the Demon Lord.

20:22.540 --> 20:24.790
So the Demon Lord died?

20:24.790 --> 20:29.320
Uh-huh. Thanks to God and the Hero,
everyone lived happily ever after.

20:30.750 --> 20:31.580
But...

20:33.120 --> 20:36.820
I can't say for certain
whether that's where the story truly ends.

20:37.620 --> 20:40.420
Wait, there's more? Read it to me!

20:40.420 --> 20:42.320
Well, if you insist...

20:44.580 --> 20:48.850
My goodness, what a surprise!
I didn't expect a pretty little lady.

20:56.060 --> 20:57.290
Who're you...?

20:57.290 --> 20:58.860
Are you a survivor?!

21:00.790 --> 21:05.500
Me? I never thought I'd be mistaken for a human...

21:05.500 --> 21:06.160
Huh?

21:06.160 --> 21:09.620
I've never been so insulted in my life...

21:09.620 --> 21:12.540
A crime like that... is punishable by death.

21:13.370 --> 21:14.500
Farga!

23:02.770 --> 23:04.080
D-Dedicated, aren't you?

23:04.080 --> 23:07.450
'Cause I can get Master to praise me
by polishing it to perfection.

23:16.250 --> 23:20.280
I shan't apologize!
I simply couldn't resist my natural instincts!

23:22.000 --> 23:22.820
Click.

23:25.000 --> 23:29.490
I had a feeling this might happen,
so I planted a bomb inside the bone!

23:30.420 --> 23:32.710
Oh, is that a new hairstyle?

23:32.710 --> 23:33.870
Yes.

23:45.920 --> 23:50.040
THE GODDESS' VOICE
